---
description: Sub2Video frontend architecture and routing
globs: ["frontend/src/**/*.vue", "frontend/src/**/*.ts"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use Vue 3 Composition API and TypeScript.
- Keep client and admin in separate layouts and route namespaces.
- Keep API access in `src/api`, state in `src/stores`, and domain types in
  `src/entities`.
- Keep mock data deterministic and isolated under `src/data` (move to `src/mocks` when the mock layer grows beyond the prototype).
- Do not put provider keys, OSS credentials, or payment secrets in the client.
- Prefer small feature components over page-local duplicated markup.
